    "_note": "11 samples at u = 0.0 (transom) to 1.0 (stem). Linear interpolation between samples. keelLift is the fraction of the draft by which the keel is lifted above its lowest point: 0 at the deepest station, 1 at the ends. ASSUMED - replace with the yard's lines plan.",
