  "_assumptions": [
    "Principal characteristics are Sunseeker's published figures for the Predator 55. Every profile, bulkhead, deck height, hatch size and pipe route is ASSUMED.",
    "The two deck hatches are 200 mm clear. That single number decides whether the stringer void is reachable, and it is question A2 for the marine engineer.",
    "The engine bay access hatch is 400 mm clear, which the hover bot can pass and the ground bot cannot.",
    "The stringer void is 700 mm wide between the stringers, which is wider than the 500 mm the inchworm can crawl in a conduit. It is a space, not a pipe, and the model has no way to say so — which is itself the finding."
  ]
